{"4158670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blast Blade", "steam_appid": 4158670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/d9f98b1b80034df990560f41b7ac9bb5.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST BLADE </strong>is a 3D fighting game set in a fantasy world.  Pick your character and blast your opponents out of the arena. Travel with charming characters on an epic quest to save the world, or rumble with friends and challengers online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new evolution in the platform fighter genre. Defeat your opponents by sending them flying out-of-bounds with powerful blast attacks. Run and dodge in dangerous terrain and breathtaking lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With freeform movement on air and ground, the battlefield is yours to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/f60414851b0183de2cc1c58f6592ee96.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle with up to 4 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to fight in serious 1-on-1 duels, team up with a friend in 2-on-2 battles, or enjoy the chaos of a 4-way free for all. Choose freely between CPU opponents and real players online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/dac1273a432d7aefaf5403873b92a17b.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the tales of Crystalia’s guardians</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the shoes of one of the four heroes on a quest to save the magical world of Crystalia from ruin. Journey into a series of battles across the world to unravel a plot that threatens to end a once peaceful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/498217db58c247c9fc8b2429c965ab1f.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master a varied cast of characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many fighters, strange and unique, are ready to brawl. Be it a woodland creature fast as a speeding bullet, a warrior princess with the power of teleportation, to a dragon who breathes lightning. With powerful moves at the press of a button, find a ferocious strategy to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/911486246a5852bd37b23025ea862e3d.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1560 height=839 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/d9f98b1b80034df990560f41b7ac9bb5.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST BLADE </strong>is a 3D fighting game set in a fantasy world.  Pick your character and blast your opponents out of the arena. Travel with charming characters on an epic quest to save the world, or rumble with friends and challengers online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new evolution in the platform fighter genre. Defeat your opponents by sending them flying out-of-bounds with powerful blast attacks. Run and dodge in dangerous terrain and breathtaking lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With freeform movement on air and ground, the battlefield is yours to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/f60414851b0183de2cc1c58f6592ee96.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle with up to 4 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to fight in serious 1-on-1 duels, team up with a friend in 2-on-2 battles, or enjoy the chaos of a 4-way free for all. Choose freely between CPU opponents and real players online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/dac1273a432d7aefaf5403873b92a17b.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the tales of Crystalia’s guardians</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the shoes of one of the four heroes on a quest to save the magical world of Crystalia from ruin. Journey into a series of battles across the world to unravel a plot that threatens to end a once peaceful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/498217db58c247c9fc8b2429c965ab1f.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master a varied cast of characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many fighters, strange and unique, are ready to brawl. Be it a woodland creature fast as a speeding bullet, a warrior princess with the power of teleportation, to a dragon who breathes lightning. With powerful moves at the press of a button, find a ferocious strategy to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/extras/911486246a5852bd37b23025ea862e3d.avif?t=1787632194\" width=1560 height=839 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Blast your friends off the stage in Blast Blade. Join the wildest third person platform fighter designed for up to 4 contenders. The only rule is to Blast first and apologize later. Four friends enter, Zero friendships leave.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/a3d74b6cfc4528d1937a48967a7c328af64da628/header.jpg?t=1787632194", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/10ab1d55d7e922fdf58ce30001233858e792d364/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787632194", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158670/10ab1d55d7e922fdf58ce30001233858e792d364/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787632194", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 4th generation or AMD FX 6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950TI or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Sil